✓ Tests website functionality end-to-end
✓ Simulates real user interactions
✓ Provides detailed failure reports
✓ Ensures website works as expected

HOW IT WORKS:
✓ Selenium controls Chrome browser
✓ Page objects organize test code
✓ Pytest manages test execution
✓ Waits ensure proper synchronization
✓ Screenshots capture failure states

WHEN TO USE:
✓ Before releasing new website features
✓ Regression testing (ensure old features still work)
✓ Performance testing (measure execution time)
✓ Health checks (website still operational)

BENEFITS:
✓ Catches bugs before users see them
✓ Saves time vs manual testing
✓ Consistent, repeatable testing
✓ Works 24/7 automatically
✓ Detailed reports for debugging


